<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#E45649;--shiki-dark:#E06C75;">      port</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">: </span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;">80</span></span>
